{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c1f1212f3eaa471600418986951e16dc7577560242bb05065903380c3840829c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0034f8d98ba0c6a704acd307f30ed8a63d77af4877a791032dfb25ffe95631f1",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n这么晚打扰真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c2b409faeb6c212444db913c43a1f81719ed0e953ed59b20277c75d4c32a3f",
      "text": "我想在今天之内，亲自向你传达谢意。\n谢谢你为我准备了那么棒的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3873f556494484620447af9ed7dad64e94033a6777ad49f866f6ef673c136964",
      "text": "我们大家一起享用了。\n味道真的非常美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c17617b49bcf661cef89ae3f680a41c9c68523e0af9ecb4bba35b793ff1f9c",
      "text": "度过了美好的一天，\n真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a71bdcd10dde26f7cc75c061af9a6eabf55ea70233e291b0187bc0e4314a7b70",
      "text": "祝你\n生日快乐",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29c0afd370b57fc908e65ff1a2cf5ebc143588850e512a59ba3ba3b63323c761",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n也由衷地向你道一声谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c549f1b8d8670721932fcf74c8a1cb815f263727f7f7f67acdeae6ebee5c26",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢你。\n特别的回忆又增添了一份呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67c6a80aa6121f017a506134534cfc37abcef72f7dcd1a8649f2d8b83e97e671",
      "text": "趁着生日，我能提一个小小的请求吗？明年要是\n制作人也能来参加的话，我会更高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7372b25bd436f19195fc1ed8a32f3c703a0d87d5fd55405bef904518e7f20431",
      "text": "冬马他们肯定也会更开心的，\n而且你要是不在，我也难免会感到落寞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_003hok_2_1_2_003_22_t01:1_2_003_22_t01:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed929219a5eef3e807a1964c85de61be5e779cd940a80f6e06a1a590d8a11765",
      "text": "那么，晚安了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
